{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港島山頂發生墮坡意外。昨晚（19日）10時許，一名男子在山頂盧吉道一處約2米高山坡大石上獨自飲酒及拍照，其間疑不勝酒力，跌落對下行人路。事主受輕傷自行報案，在場接受初步檢查，最終拒絕送院。</p><p>據了解，事主26歲印度籍，持有本港身份證。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主受輕傷，拒絕送院。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200238136085450752846792.jpeg/W53iYuF2jOHyGzVcZVVusoeoUfcTnLeEeSdtxkMnbcY\"/><figcaption>事主受輕傷，拒絕送院。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主在山頂盧吉道一處約2米高的山坡大石飲酒自拍，疑不勝酒力跌落對下行人路。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200238313739653120407982.jpeg/64ujiO9u705eUUJlpXBk5yR7SOgTRTWQuG0Sm4JtEps\"/><figcaption>事主在山頂盧吉道一處約2米高的山坡大石飲酒自拍，疑不勝酒力跌落對下行人路。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200238310111449088861037.jpeg/BUdXIuLZFUDRNGwHgyDmPBx5wpaP9CASjcJwvrfCcL4\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200238316940038144463718.jpeg/_jDKQ6skNd7seLnIo7HFKA2j_5Gb4JndD51cMDWdXDA\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為山頂盧吉道。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200238306843955200624708.jpeg/nW6tc3do_TFeg4FuncCRdLsDA3ze79H0ufnpp4P56ac\"/><figcaption>現場為山頂盧吉道。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:23:53.721368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:12:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:42.001584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:17:30.300542+00:00","content_hash":"83712b37300a9b503b863897f7568b482e807cf44648e5b65a460b0f83bc91e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}